# Tailwind utility

Style with Tailwind utilities, `libs/shared-ui/src/styles/globals.css`, and shadcn primitives from `@namma-medmate/shared-ui`.

No new component `.css` files, CSS modules, or styled-components. Translate Stitch HTML into Tailwind classes — do not paste a second stylesheet. Do not hand-roll Button/Input/Dialog.

```tsx
// BAD
import './auth-widget.css';
export function AuthWidget() { return <div className="widget" />; }

// GOOD
import { Button } from '@namma-medmate/shared-ui';
export function AuthWidget() {
  return <section className="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-lg p-6"><Button>Save</Button></section>;
}
```
